  "notes": "{伸|の}びる is an ichidan intransitive verb meaning to stretch, extend, or grow.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{自動詞|じどうし}→自動詞：10977_jidoushi⟧ (intransitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{伸|の}ばす→伸ばす：01973_nobasu⟧ (transitive, to stretch something)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{髪|かみ}→髪：02196_kami⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{伸|の}びる: hair grows\n- ⟦{背|せ}→背：02907_se⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{伸|の}びる: to grow taller\n- ⟦{売|う}り{上|あ}げ→売上：04102_uriage⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{伸|の}びる: sales increase\n- ⟦{能力|のうりょく}→能力：03541_nouryoku⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{伸|の}びる: ability improves\n- ⟦{麺|めん}→麺：14644_men⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{伸|の}びる: noodles get soggy\n\nKANJI DISTINCTION:\n- {伸|の}びる: physical stretching/growth\n- ⟦{延|の}びる→延びる：19599_nobiru⟧: time extension (⟦{会議|かいぎ}→会議：00710_kaigi⟧⟦が→が：00051_ga⟧{延|の}びる = meeting runs long)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{伸|の}び→伸び：19827_nobi⟧: growth, stretch (noun)\n- ⟦{伸|の}び{伸|の}び→伸び伸び：10397_nobinobi⟧: freely, at ease",
